  "details": "I would like worlds to be able to display different thumbnails, titles, and descriptions based on the user’s language settings.\n\nSimilar to YouTube, please allow creators to set multiple versions of thumbnails, titles, and descriptions in advance, and automatically show the appropriate one according to the viewer’s language preference.\n\nThis feature would eliminate the need to cram multiple languages into a single title and description field, preventing text from being cut off. It would also make it much easier for creators to properly target and attract users from different language regions.",
